+*   **Performance:** Achieves high-quality novel view synthesis for urban scenes with reduced ghosting artifacts compared to pixel-aligned methods [S2].
+*   **Strengths:** Global consistency, reduced ghosting, fast feed-forward inference [S2].
+*   **Limitations:** Relies on the quality of monocular depth estimators; may lose high-frequency appearance details if primitives are downsampled too aggressively [S2].
